        "contenuto_esteso": "For those not familiar with Sun Tzu, he was a famous Chinese strategist and military philosopher living between 400-600 B.C.E. His most important book, \"The Art of War,\" is the ancient companion to Karl Von Clausewitz’s modern masterpiece \"On War.\" Sun's most interesting pieces of advice were that the best way to win was \"without fighting\"..."
